# Skip Puppeteer's ~150MB Chromium download during `npm install`.
# Puppeteer is a build-time-only devDependency used by the profile-PDF
# generator (scripts/generate-resume.mjs); the generated PDF is committed to
# public/, so CI/hosting (e.g. Vercel) never needs the browser binary. This
# keeps installs/deploys fast and avoids flaky Chromium downloads.
# To generate the PDF locally, run once:  PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD=false npm install
puppeteer_skip_download=true
